## 2. What is deliberately NOT ported (D5/D6)

- `finetune_cond.py` + `test_finetune_cond.py` (exp_03 fine-tune driver; hosts exp_04 warmup, exp_05 freeze-BN, exp_06 lr-schedule). B-F is from-scratch.
