- `tools/bn_drift_probe.py`, `test_bn_drift_probe.py` (exp_05).
- Post-launch FA additions: batched orbit / `max_fwd_samples` (exp_11/14), yaw-aug (exp_15), ARE (exp_16), cyl routing (exp_19), `fa_cartesian` (exp_21).
