    87	### Model Unwrapping
    88	The checkpoint files created during training include the training wrapper, which greatly increases the size of the checkpoint file.
    89	`unwrap_model.py` takes in a wrapped model checkpoint and saves a new checkpoint file including only the model itself.
    90	
    91	That can be run with from the repo root with:
    92	```bash
    93	python unwrap_model.py \
    94	--model-config /path/to/model/config \
    95	--ckpt-path /path/to/wrapped/ckpt \
    96	--name model_unwrap \
    97	--use-safetensors
    98	```
